{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13353","headline":"宣州东峰亭各赋一物得古壁苔 · 刘太真","name":"宣州东峰亭各赋一物得古壁苔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苒苒温寒泉，绵绵古危壁。\n光含孤翠动，色与暮云寂。\n深浅松月间，幽人自登历。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘太真","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13353.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13353","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}